      "name": "Reindsurm Amurusa",
      "effect": "You can Ritual Summon this card with \"Reindsurm Conquest\". If this card is Ritual Summoned: You can add 2 non-WIND \"Reindsurm\" monsters from your Deck to your hand. If this card is sent to the GY, except by battle: You can Ritual Summon 1 Insect Ritual Monster from your hand, by Tributing monsters from your hand or field, and/or shuffling Insect and/or Dragon monsters from your GY into the Deck, whose total Levels equal or exceed its Level. You can only use each effect of \"Reindsurm Amurusa\" once per turn.",
